	)
	(text "C15 FIXED: 10 nF -> 1 nF C0G per TI AMC3330 datasheet Fig. 7-2 / 7-5 (input filter now ~16 kHz instead of ~1.6 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 373.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf6ef732-466c-54ba-8f7b-da70e84c9276")
	)
	(text "HI-Z gain: G = 0.1 x (1 + 30k/RG).  RG open: +/-10 V FS.  RG 30k: +/-5 V.  RG 3.32k: +/-1 V.  Input Z = 100 Mohm per leg to HGND_Z."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 378.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fb556ac8-744e-5870-8488-1fee17e4860d")
	)
	(text "JP1 selects AMC VDD: 1-2 (default) = 3V3 so AMC outputs can never exceed the Giga ADC rail; 2-3 = 5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 383.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "807fd461-a1e9-548f-89c6-76073fee1360")
	)
	(text "PS1 CCG3-12-12DF isolation is 1500 VDC -- the HI-Z channel is limited to that; the other two keep the AMC rating."
